      'There are 100 doors in a row, all initially closed. Person 1 opens every door. Person 2 toggles (closes) every 2nd door (2, 4, 6...). Person 3 toggles every 3rd door. This continues until Person 100 toggles the 100th door. At the end, how many doors remain open?',
